Update developer guide glossary for LinkedOut","messageBody":"The glossary contains terminology from the AddressBook template\nthat does not reflect LinkedOut\u0027s applicant tracking features.\n\nReplace the private contact detail entry with definitions for\napplicants, applications, job descriptions, statuses, and indices.\nBase these definitions on the official Feature Specification tab\nand retain Mainstream OS for legacy compatibility.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":5,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"8e3366d74ba3d7f1a688c1dde22bfe2589834191","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Clean up About Us page","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":22}}},{"hash":"be3ba96cdd2cacf25c759586d318917399a5ed2c","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #50 from cewau/update-Zewei-AboutUs","messageBody":"Clean up About Us page","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"d04818cd0813f8fa4d23aab20366a82d5f5b06e1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add initial applicant view command","messageBody":"LinkedOut needs a command to view an applicant, but the parser has no\nview route and the dedicated details panel has not been built yet.\n\nAdd view INDEX using the existing index parser and command result\ndisplay to show the applicant\u0027s name and email. Preserve the displayed\nlist and its filter, and report invalid indices with a usage hint or\nvalid range.\n\nKeep this first slice independent of hyphen-option parsing and model\nchanges so the details panel can be introduced in a later PR.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":104,"deletions":0},"docs":{"insertions":16,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":127,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"c627089bd7b00eed6cc6682a67d7a7ed00b94086","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #40 from BirdsArentReal/branch-W7-DG-AddUserProfile","messageBody":"W7-C: Update DG -- Subissue 1","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash"